3:30-4:30 p.m.
Solving Your eBusiness Challenges

To aid companies in their eBusiness transformation, the Forrester Executive Strategy Forum will pioneer a new problem solving instrument and format.  The audience will self select into groups based on the biggest challenges that they face. The Forrester led sessions will use Visual Explorer, a tool for helping groups make sense of complex issues and challenges. Visual Explorer fosters constructive thinking and insightful conversations to address these eBusiness roadblocks. The attendees will network and interact with their peers on issues like, "How you develop the 'eLeadership' within your company to become an eBusiness?" or "How do you successful manage your relationship with an eMarketplaces?".

