All attendees, speakers, and exhibitors are invited to join us for a networking dinner reception at the 600 Club in historic Fenway Park, the oldest ballpark in the country. The 600 Club is a glassed-in seating section behind home plate. Guests will have the opportunity to tour the park.

Transportation will be provided to and from this event.




